<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Hee hee hee, splendid. So you remembered Natsumi Kogori's warning.<PG>
Yes, on the summit, Natsumi Kogori warned Ryoji Kogori not to get in Mifuyu Niimura's way.<PG>
Since the warning came at that point, one could say that no matter how much was changed before it, it would have been meaningless.<PG>
Therefore, not stopping Mifuyu Niimura when she was about to attack Natsumi Kogori with a mace―that was the branching point.<PG>
Akane Kogori did not know about the warning, so if only Ryoji Kogori had been the one to notice it.<PG>
Now then, I will guide you.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
